%SIXMD 1
# @?FACTOR - FACTOR AN 18-BIT INTEGER

## DESCRIPTION

PRINTS THE DECIMAL PRIME FACTORS OF A POSITIVE 18-BIT DECIMAL INTEGER.

USAGE IS 'FACTOR NUMBER'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/FACTOR
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/FACTOR.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

## @?SEE ALSO

### @?DAS
